{
  "dom_id": "step-e12973",
  "name": "Example: Dividing a Positive Number by a Negative Number",
  "problem": "Calculate the value of $50 \\div (-5).$",
  "worked_solution": "We have to divide a positive number $\\color{blue}(50)$ by a negative one $\\color{red}(-5).$ So the result will be negative:\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/linear/14147219/assets/b60e5b61abd8610de7dd17c7cf2b306fad99db1eae23b2daee61cffc0a54bdb8.svg)\n\nNow, to compute the number that goes in the box, we divide $50$ by $5$ without any signs: $50 \\div 5 = 10.$ Therefore,  we get\n\n$$\n{\\color{blue}{50}} \\div {\\color{red}{(-5)}} = {\\color{red}{-10}}.\n$$",
  "calculator_instructions": "",
  "fields": [],
  "problem_field_keys": [],
  "answer_fields_complete": null,
  "result": null,
  "proof_feedback": null,
  "html": "<div id=\"step-e12973\" class=\"step\" style=\"display: block;\">\n    \n                 \n                <div class=\"example\">\n                    <div class=\"stepHeader\">\n                        <div class=\"stepName\"><span class=\"stepType\">Example:</span> Dividing a Positive Number by a Negative Number</div>       \n                        <div class=\"helpButton\" stepid=\"e12973\">?</div>\n                    </div>\n            \n                    <div class=\"exampleQuestion\">\n                        <style type=\"text/css\">\n                            .mjpage .MJX-monospace {\n                            font-family: monospace\n                            }\n\n                            .mjpage .MJX-sans-serif {\n                            font-family: sans-serif\n                            }\n\n                            .mjpage {\n                            display: inline;\n                            font-style: normal;\n                            font-weight: normal;\n                            line-height: normal;\n                            font-size: 100%;\n                            font-size-adjust: none;\n                            text-indent: 0;\n                            text-align: left;\n                            text-transform: none;\n                            letter-spacing: normal;\n                            word-spacing: normal;\n                            word-wrap: normal;\n                            white-space: nowrap;\n                            float: none;\n                            direction: ltr;\n                            max-width: none;\n                            max-height: none;\n                            min-width: 0;\n                            min-height: 0;\n                            border: 0;\n                            padding: 0;\n                            margin: 0\n                            }\n\n                            .mjpage * {\n               